<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves largely unchanged in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves largely unchanged in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to May 30 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to May 23:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 58,468	58,469</p>
<p> Money market intervention    12,568	12,568</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,908	 1,908</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,909	 1,909</p>
<p> Other				 6,644	 6,610</p>
<p> Total assets		     81,497	81,464</p>
<p>In the previous week, to May 23, reserves fell by 476 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
